# Xsfltinx - vectorial quarter-precision expanding dot-product extension in integer registers
#
# The alternate-format (.ab) variants have the same encodings as the .b ones
# and are therefore not listed separately.
vfdotpexa.s.b    rd rs1 rs2         31..30=2 29..25=0x1C 14=0 13..12=0 6..2=0x0C 1..0=3
vfdotpexa.s.r.b  rd rs1 rs2         31..30=2 29..25=0x1C 14=1 13..12=0 6..2=0x0C 1..0=3
vfdotpexb.s.b    rd rs1 rs2         31..30=2 29..25=0x1E 14=0 13..12=0 6..2=0x0C 1..0=3
vfdotpexb.s.r.b  rd rs1 rs2         31..30=2 29..25=0x1E 14=1 13..12=0 6..2=0x0C 1..0=3
